  "description": "Stocks Pick Tracker - Last Update: 30 March 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>This document will be updated at least weekly, you can see the “Last Update” in the subtitle. <em><strong>Changes will be</strong></em> <em><strong>Bold and Italicized</strong></em>. Stocks will be labeled: “In 📈” if I bought or shorted, or “watching 👀” if they are just on my radar. Each stock will be labeled with entry price/range and stop price/range. Additionally, these will be noted, a brief summary, for WHY I like them or dislike them. Note that many of my charts and stocks are based off the weekly, as this timeframe allows people time to make decisions on their own. There will be NO DAY TRADES ❌</p><p>Be cognizant that NO ONE can get every stock right…some of these WILL be losers. Risk management is a MUST. Do not come crying to me if something goes against us, it is just the nature of the markets and it is why stops and bracket orders are available. Questions are welcome in the chat, officially Monday to Thursday mornings (though I am in the chat far more often). I will copy and paste “Timothy’s Stocks” once a month into a new document, to reduce how much people have to scroll down to view the document.</p><p>General Market Update: Stocks continue to whiplash investors, and the VIX continues to make higher lows and higher highs. Until the VIX has a clear break in trend, we remain cash heavy. We do have 1 short position that has been running since 24 Feb and 1 small long position as a test whether the market is presenting a bounce. </p><p></p><p>⬇️ Positions and Watchlist below this line ⬇️</p><p></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
